<title>UK: Burnfield rejects offer from Fairey.</title>
<headline>Burnfield rejects offer from Fairey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burnfield Plc on Tuesday said it rejected an offer for it from electronics and specialist engineering manufacturer Fairey Group Plc, which valued Burnfield at 51.1 million pounds.</p>
</text>
